# LangGraph service

- AI integrations live in `apps/ai` (Python, uv, LangGraph). Angular and NestJS call it over HTTP. Do not embed LangGraph in Node.
- Require Python `>=3.11,<3.14`. Add dependencies with `npx nx run ai:add --args=<package>`.
- Graphs live in `apps/ai/src/ai/graphs/`. HTTP routes stay thin and call a graph.
- Cover graph nodes and routes with pytest.
